            "type": "paragraph",
            "text": "North America continues to carry the expansion story; EMEA underperformed on both new logos and expansion, which we attribute to the unfilled enterprise AE seats (4 of 9 open all quarter) and to two slipped seven-figure renewals that closed in the first week of June and will be recognized in Q3."
