                  { "text": "Close the EMEA enterprise coverage gap: all four open AE seats accepted-offer by 31 July; interim coverage via two NA overlay reps continues through September." },
                  { "text": "Ship field-level audit history (September release) and proactively re-engage the seven product-gap churns and 23 open opportunities where it was cited as a blocker." },
                  { "text": "Mid-market cycle-time program: introduce mutual close plans at stage 3 and a pre-approved security review packet; target median cycle back under 80 days by Q4." },
                  { "text": "Extend save-desk authority to 18-month term extensions (currently 14) based on the concession NPV analysis in section 5." },
                  { "text": "Complete SOC 2 Type II renewal fieldwork by 15 August to keep the two public-sector stage-4 deals on their award timelines." }
